</p>
         <div class="chrmnz9 ne9"></div>
         <h1 data-sr="wait 0.5s, enter left">Our acheivements</h1>
         <div class="achcon">
            <p data-sr="wait 0.6s, enter right">The numerous awards and the LEED Platinum certification that the Pride Group has won is a testimony to our unwavering focus on superlative quality and to delivering beyond expectations to all our stakeholders -- customers, clients and partners.&nbsp; The untiring efforts of the leadership team and the entire workforce have helped us raise construction standards that are recognized by the authorities and the customers alike. Our deliverables stand out because of the immaculate planning involved in them which produces enduring quality.
</p>
